{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-concurrency","title":"结构化并发与 errgroup","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/structured-concurrency","wordCount":551,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"race-detection-profiling","title":"竞态检测与性能诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/race-detection-profiling","wordCount":652,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrent-service-checklist","title":"并发服务设计清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/concurrent-service-checklist","wordCount":612,"readingTime":3}],"introMarkdown":"# 工程实践\n\n本章把前三章的模式与技巧放回真实生产环境：errgroup 与 context 如何实现结构化并发（启动的 goroutine 必须有确定的退出路径）、竞态检测与 pprof 诊断如何在上线前后守住正确性与性能、以及一套完整的并发服务设计清单——从 GOMAXPROCS 容器适配到优雅关停。\n\n三篇文档面向不同时间点：结构化并发是设计时写的，竞态检测是开发/测试时跑的，服务设计清单是上线前对照的。合在一起形成一个完整的并发工程闭环。\n"}